* Fully differential sampling-feedback OTA.
* Pin order: vss iref vdd vinn vinp vocm voutn voutp
* iref is the only external analog bias port.
*
* The previous submission used l=1 um for small-geometry diode-connected
* devices and failed model parameter checking. This replacement uses the
* supported 0.15 um minimum core-device length throughout.

.subckt sampling_feedback_ota vss iref vdd vinn vinp vocm voutn voutp

* Bias generator: diode-connected devices establish local gate biases.
XBN bn bn vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=4 nf=2
XBP bp bp vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=8 nf=2

* Differential input stage with current-mirror-derived tail bias.
XTAIL nt bn vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.30 w=16 nf=4
XINN voutn vinn nt vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.30 w=32 nf=8
XINP voutp vinp nt vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.30 w=32 nf=8

* Continuous-time common-mode detector and control stage.
XCMTAIL nct bn vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.30 w=8 nf=2
XCMREF ncmref vocm nct vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.30 w=8 nf=2
XCMSENSE ncmout cm_sense nct vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.30 w=8 nf=2
XCMLOADR ncmref ncmref vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.30 w=16 nf=4
XCMLOADO ncmout ncmref vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.30 w=16 nf=4

* Matched output averaging network.
RAVG1 voutp cm_sense 1meg
RAVG2 voutn cm_sense 1meg
RCM1 cm_sense ncmout 1k
RCM2 cm_sense vss 1meg

* Shared PMOS load control.
XLP voutp cm_sense vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.30 w=48 nf=12
XLN voutn cm_sense vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.30 w=48 nf=12

.ends sampling_feedback_ota
